      "name": "review",
      "title": "Review: a pointer to the review skills",
      "description": "Where to start when a person or an agent reviews a document folio larger than one chapter, such as a DAK or an L1 digital transformation handbook. A pointer, not a method: it names the review skills that already exist, says which question each one answers, and gives the order to read them in. Use when someone asks \"how do I review this\", when a review session starts on a large folio, or before writing a new review skill, so it is not written twice.",
